{"chapter_id":"main-quest-73515","main_id":73515,"main_title":"沙漠虫害·本论","main_description":"经过三天的奔波，「对沙虫用杀虫炮」终于将展示它的威力…","chapter_title":"沙漠虫害·本论","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7351501,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7351501,"sequence":5,"variant":0,"line_id":735150107,"next_line_ids":[735150108,735150110],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30342,"speaker_text_hash":1180019760,"speaker":"维纳亚克","speaker_raw":"维纳亚克","text_hash":3787172642,"text":"啊——我想到一个好主意！你都为「对沙虫用杀虫炮」忙前忙后了这么久，这首次试射的荣耀…干脆就交给你吧！","raw_text":"啊——我想到一个好主意！你都为「对沙虫用杀虫炮」忙前忙后了这么久，这首次试射的荣耀…干脆就交给你吧！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7351501.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-73515","main_id":73515,"main_title":"沙漠虫害·本论","main_description":"经过三天的奔波，「对沙虫用杀虫炮」终于将展示它的威力…","chapter_title":"沙漠虫害·本论","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7351501,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7351501,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":735150108,"next_line_ids":[735150109],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speaker_id":0,"speaker_text_hash":0,"speaker":"旅行者","speaker_raw":"旅行者","text_hash":1017649770,"text":"你不打算自己来吗？","raw_text":"你不打算自己来吗？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7351501.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-73515","main_id":73515,"main_title":"沙漠虫害·本论","main_description":"经过三天的奔波，「对沙虫用杀虫炮」终于将展示它的威力…","chapter_title":"沙漠虫害·本论","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7351501,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7351501,"sequence":7,"variant":0,"line_id":735150109,"next_line_ids":[735150112],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30342,"speaker_text_hash":1180019760,"speaker":"维纳亚克","speaker_raw":"维纳亚克","text_hash":3845891962,"text":"我只要看着它落地就已经心满意足啦！何况让别人去点火，我们才能欣赏到它开火时的全貌嘛…咳！总之！","raw_text":"我只要看着它落地就已经心满意足啦！何况让别人去点火，我们才能欣赏到它开火时的全貌嘛…咳！总之！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7351501.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-73515","main_id":73515,"main_title":"沙漠虫害·本论","main_description":"经过三天的奔波，「对沙虫用杀虫炮」终于将展示它的威力…","chapter_title":"沙漠虫害·本论","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7351501,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7351501,"sequence":8,"variant":0,"line_id":735150112,"next_line_ids":[735150113],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30342,"speaker_text_hash":1180019760,"speaker":"维纳亚克","speaker_raw":"维纳亚克","text_hash":1726876498,"text":"你只需要从魔物手里保护好充能装置，等待能量蓄满之后，看准沙虫露出破绽的瞬间——再狠狠地往炮台上敲上一记就好啦！","raw_text":"你只需要从魔物手里保护好充能装置，等待能量蓄满之后，看准沙虫露出破绽的瞬间——再狠狠地往炮台上敲上一记就好啦！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7351501.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-73515","main_id":73515,"main_title":"沙漠虫害·本论","main_description":"经过三天的奔波，「对沙虫用杀虫炮」终于将展示它的威力…","chapter_title":"沙漠虫害·本论","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7351501,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7351501,"sequence":9,"variant":0,"line_id":735150113,"next_line_ids":[735150114],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30342,"speaker_text_hash":1180019760,"speaker":"维纳亚克","speaker_raw":"维纳亚克","text_hash":4033133274,"text":"剩下的事情，点火装置和自动修正机关会帮你搞定！","raw_text":"剩下的事情，点火装置和自动修正机关会帮你搞定！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7351501.json"}
